      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "房间主控制；手机保留 54px，hover 仅调低亮度。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-room-play\" aria-label=\"播放\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-room-play{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:54px;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--room-accent,#167eb3);color:white;transition:all .3s}.ds-room-play:hover{filter:brightness(.92)}.ds-room-play:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--room-accent,#167eb3);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-room-play{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Transport",
